Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Distinguish visual batch quota pauses

Classify daily quota exhaustion separately from transient throttles in the visual batch job runner. Persist resume timing, pause or block reasons, affected sample IDs, and attempt state on jobs and items so interrupted runs can be diagnosed and resumed safely. Add regression coverage proving short RetryInfo/transient throttle responses pause for rate limits rather than becoming permanent daily quota blocks.
